{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00690",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.54,
      "end_seconds": 10.29,
      "duration_seconds": 9.75,
      "text": "Good afternoon. Before we start, what shall I call you, Mr Subramaniam, or Raghu, or sir? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.24,
      "end_seconds": 26.22,
      "duration_seconds": 14.98,
      "text": "Raghu is fine, everyone calls me that. I was a schoolteacher, you know, forty years, and they still call me Sir at the vegetable shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.48,
      "end_seconds": 35.07,
      "duration_seconds": 7.59,
      "text": "Sir it is, then, in the vegetable shop. And this is? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 35.8,
      "end_seconds": 46.4,
      "duration_seconds": 10.6,
      "text": "I'm Sunita, I stay with him as his carer. I'm here because the evenings are very difficult now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.34,
      "end_seconds": 52.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Tell me about the evenings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 53.83,
      "end_seconds": 69.77,
      "duration_seconds": 15.94,
      "text": "He gets confused. After the lights come on he asks me where his wife is, and she passed ten years ago. It started about three months ago, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.28,
      "end_seconds": 79.67,
      "duration_seconds": 8.39,
      "text": "No, no, it's not three months. It began last month, one month, maybe, when the clocks changed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.78,
      "end_seconds": 91.61,
      "duration_seconds": 10.83,
      "text": "One month, or three months. We'll note somewhere between one and three months. And what happens during the confusion, Raghu?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.44,
      "end_seconds": 100.68,
      "duration_seconds": 6.24,
      "text": "I get a bit muddled. It's the television, it confuses me. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.26,
      "end_seconds": 106.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Is he restless too, Sunita?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 109.4,
      "end_seconds": 118.22,
      "duration_seconds": 8.82,
      "text": "Yes, in the evenings he paces. Up and down the corridor, it takes an hour to settle him."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.75,
      "end_seconds": 121.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Any falls?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.61,
      "end_seconds": 129.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "No falls. I am a very steady man."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 129.91,
      "end_seconds": 137.38,
      "duration_seconds": 7.47,
      "text": "Sir, you fell in the bathroom two weeks ago. I helped you up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.14,
      "end_seconds": 143.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "That was a slip, it was nothing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.74,
      "end_seconds": 155.0,
      "duration_seconds": 9.26,
      "text": "I'll record that Sunita saw a fall and you say it didn't happen. Any fever or cold symptoms recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.76,
      "end_seconds": 159.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "None of that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.11,
      "end_seconds": 163.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "What medicines is he taking, Sunita?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 166.34,
      "end_seconds": 175.52,
      "duration_seconds": 9.18,
      "text": "Amlodipine, 5 mg, once a day. Donepezil, 5 mg, at night. And tamsulosin, 400 micrograms, after dinner."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.61,
      "end_seconds": 180.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "And any allergies to medicines, Raghu?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.37,
      "end_seconds": 186.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "No, I have no allergies. None."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 187.48,
      "end_seconds": 198.24,
      "duration_seconds": 10.76,
      "text": "Sir, the antibiotic you had at the hospital last year, you were so itchy. I don't know which one it was."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.38,
      "end_seconds": 203.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "I don't remember any itching."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.26,
      "end_seconds": 209.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "I'll keep both. Health problems, Raghu?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.83,
      "end_seconds": 214.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "High blood pressure, and the prostate, it's enlarged."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.8,
      "end_seconds": 218.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Any operations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.63,
      "end_seconds": 225.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "Cataract, both eyes, two years ago. Very good surgeon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.72,
      "end_seconds": 230.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Who is at home with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 231.81,
      "end_seconds": 238.28,
      "duration_seconds": 6.47,
      "text": "I live in with him, his son visits at the weekends."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.28,
      "end_seconds": 246.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "Raghu, can you tell me today's date? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.1,
      "end_seconds": 254.59,
      "duration_seconds": 6.49,
      "text": "It's... Tuesday? No, I'm not sure. Sunita will know. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.89,
      "end_seconds": 260.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Do you know where we are?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 262.11,
      "end_seconds": 272.21,
      "duration_seconds": 10.1,
      "text": "A hospital. No, the clinic, the doctor's clinic. I know it very well, I come here every year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.88,
      "end_seconds": 295.21,
      "duration_seconds": 10.33,
      "text": "He knows his name and the place but not the date. Now stand up and walk to the door for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 295.95,
      "end_seconds": 299.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Slowly, sir, take your stick. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.38,
      "end_seconds": 305.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "He walks slowly with a stick, but he's steady enough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.6,
      "end_seconds": 310.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "I told you, steady. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.94,
      "end_seconds": 316.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Any trouble passing water, Raghu?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.84,
      "end_seconds": 321.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "No, nothing now, the tablet helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.6,
      "end_seconds": 334.83,
      "duration_seconds": 12.23,
      "text": "What I think is happening is evening confusion, what we call sundowning, and I'd like to rule out other causes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 337.07,
      "end_seconds": 340.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Is it serious, doctor? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.91,
      "end_seconds": 351.79,
      "duration_seconds": 8.88,
      "text": "It's common at his age. I'd like to arrange blood tests to rule out infection and vitamin problems."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 354.65,
      "end_seconds": 358.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "When should I bring him? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.73,
      "end_seconds": 376.63,
      "duration_seconds": 15.9,
      "text": "The blood test is at the front desk, this week. Keep the house bright in the evenings, close the curtains before dark, and keep the television off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 378.88,
      "end_seconds": 381.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "I'll do that. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 383.84,
      "end_seconds": 393.87,
      "duration_seconds": 10.03,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in two weeks, and Sunita, write down what happens each evening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 394.8,
      "end_seconds": 398.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Two weeks. Thank you, doctor. ~"
    }
  ]
}
